{"articleNo":"654","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=654&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 조기졸업 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.19","hit":"15090","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY목각파임B'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font size=\"3\">2009학년도 조기졸업 신청 안내</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 입학후 4학기 이내에 조기졸업을 신청하여야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">나.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 직전학기까지 매학기 15학점이상 수강하여 성적 평점평균이 4.30이상인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\"> 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">다. 징계를 받지 아니한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0000cd\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#708090\">2.신청기간</font> :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>2009. 2. 23(월) ～ 2. 27(금)</strong></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#0000cd\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#708090\">3. 제출서류</font> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>조기졸업신청서 및 성적증명서 1부</strong></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 신청 장소 :<font color=\"#708090\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#708090\">해당 종합학사행정실</font> </strong></span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 테크노관 : 478-7359</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 디지털관 : 478-7751</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 글로벌관 : 478-7598</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 조기졸업 요건</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">조기졸업을 신청한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 6학기이상 등록하여 소정의 전과정을 이수한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(건축학전공은 8학기이상 등록하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 졸업요건을 모두 충족한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적 평점평균이 4.30이상인 자 </span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">☞ </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">학적부에 사진(학사서비스센터 ☎478-7066)이 없거나 학적</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">부기재사항(영문명,한자명, 주소, e-mail, 연락처)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">이&nbsp;정확하지 않은 경우&nbsp;성적열람이 불가능하오니&nbsp;</font></span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">반</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2009.&nbsp; 2. 19.</font>&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장<br></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
